Lampac Aladin module (Modules/OnlineRUS/Aladin/AladinWsSession.cs, lampac-nextgen/lampac, AGPL-3.0).

A playback's CDN link stays valid only while its WebSocket session reports playback. The session's worker
stops for good after 15 minutes without a lookup or 20 failed connects, yet AladinSessionManager keeps
returning that dead session for the same pnk, so every later link for the episode answers 403 until Lampac
restarts. Replace a finished session on the next lookup.

